charges_raw:
Waging, or attempting to wage war, or abetting waging of war against the Government of India; 

Collecting arms, etc. with intention of waging war against the Government of India; 


Attempt to cause explosion, or for making or keeping explosive with intent to endanger life or property; 

Making or possessing explosives under suspicious circumstances; 

Brings into, or takes out of India, any arms or ammunition of any class or description in contravention of Section 11 of Arms Act;
